# The holomap, from the save saveload.keys made, kept with dosrun -k and
# given the holomap outside the prison, where nothing is confiscated: for
# a player name of three letters, ListFlagGame[FLAG_HOLOMAP] is byte 6,
# NumCube byte 261 and SceneStartX bytes 270-271 (-1: the scene's own
# start),
#
#     printf '\001' | dd of=S1234.LBA bs=1 seek=6 conv=notrunc
#     printf '\001' | dd of=S1234.LBA bs=1 seek=261 conv=notrunc
#     printf '\377\377' | dd of=S1234.LBA bs=1 seek=270 conv=notrunc
#
# Areas are of the 1280x960 screen dosrun's DOSBox draws in.

hold 0.05
wait menu 814x76+234+470 150
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
# the pipes of the scene outside the prison (the guard walks)
wait outside 300x250+800+130 120
key h
# the holomap's title
wait holo 280x70+500+130 60
sleep 3
shot holomap
key Escape
wait after 300x250+800+130 60
